rule SelectionIsNotApplication
	statement: Selecting a product is not applying, applying is not approval, approval is not acceptance and acceptance is not execution. A recorded 'no' closes the case: do not re-offer the same product.
	lineageTag: 14ab153b-153e-54b5-8c28-2ddc83d40ac7

	ruleReferencedEntity Product
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty SupportedActions

		ruleReferencedProperty UnderwritingRequired
